note OM-1 twin of the section 6 part checks via the OM-1 write slice check (OMEGESE 9.5: write traps 3
note unless n <= len A and off <= len A - n, before the call): o = len-2 = 8, k = 4 on len 10: k <= len - o fails, trap 3 (exit 103).
fn main to int
a = new uchar 10 46
o = ulong 8
r = write 1 a o 4
ret 0
end
